59:46Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119437","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119437","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119437.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119437.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Related: #111936\r\n\r\nThe most recent core meeting touched on how bloated the `main/` directory is, and how almost all of it can be relocated to `core/` or a specific server. In the middle of that conversation, I remembered that one of my PRs actually addressed exactly that, by migrating `Performance` to `core/profiling/`. Originally intended to help the above PR, as the `main/` location inherently broke several implicit dependency structures, but it fell to the wayside for one reason or another. After a quick rebase and some finishing touches, this is now good to go!","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119437/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119437/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}